        { q: "The 3.0 Ω resistor is now removed. Explain, without detailed calculation, what happens to the voltmeter reading.", marks: 2, markscheme: ["External resistance increases (to 6.0 Ω), so the current from the battery decreases ✓", "The lost volts (Ir) decrease, so the terminal p.d. (voltmeter reading) increases (to about 11 V) ✓"] }
